CORE CONCEPT
============================================================

Use the term:

    Budget Plan

Do NOT use "classification" for this feature.

A Budget Plan represents:

    1. A user-supplied plan name
    2. Start Date
    3. End Date
    4. Category Scope
    5. N selected broad Categories when using Selected Categories mode
    6. Total Budget

Category Scope has two valid modes:

    ALL
    SELECTED

Examples:

    Plan Name:
        Fall Groceries

    Start Date:
        09/01/2026

    End Date:
        11/30/2026

    Category Scope:
        SELECTED

    Categories:
        Food
        Household

    Budget:
        3000.00

or:

    Plan Name:
        Total Household Spending

    Start Date:
        01/01/2027

    End Date:
        12/31/2027

    Category Scope:
        ALL

    Budget:
        24000.00

The Budget Plan itself contains configuration only.

All spending data remains derived from the existing Purchase History workbook.

Deleting a Budget Plan must therefore NEVER delete or modify Purchase History
purchase data.

